#. ja: 解放者殿、ご苦労さまでございます。<br>「レジスタンス勲章」について、なにか御用でしょうか？
#. de: Was kann ich für dich tun? Geht es um Widerstandsorden?
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Voulez-vous recevoir une médaille, ou en savoir plus sur elles, peut-être<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>day to you</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day to you<else>evening</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>day to you</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 17)>day to you<else>evening</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_000:1"
msgid "Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>day to you</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day to you<else>evening</if></if>, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. How may I help you?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 解放者殿、ご苦労さまでございます。<br>「レジスタンス勲章」はすべて授与させていただきましたが、<br>なにか、私に御用でしょうか？
#. de: Was kann ich für dich tun? Du hast bereits alle Widerstandsorden, die ich zu verleihen habe, erhalten.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Je n'ai plus de médailles à vous donner, mais peut-être puis-je vous renseigner.
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>day to you</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day to you<else>evening</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>day to you</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 17)>day to you<else>evening</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_010:1"
msgid "Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>day to you</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day to you<else>evening</if></if>, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. You have received all the accolades one might possibly earn from the Resistance, but if there is aught else I can do for you..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「戦果認定証」の交換
#. de: Frontwissen-Marken erhalten
#. fr: Recevoir des attestations de services rendus
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A1_000_000:1"
msgid "Proof of mettle exchange."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 戦果認定証を渡して、「レジスタンス勲章」を受け取る
#. de: Frontwissen-Marken gegen Widerstandsorden eintauschen
#. fr: Recevoir des médailles de la résistance
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Resistance honors exchange."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「レジスタンス勲章」について詳しく聞く
#. de: Mehr über Widerstandsorden erfahren
#. fr: En savoir plus sur les médailles de la résistance
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Inquire about Resistance honors."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A1_000_010:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……おや、解放者殿はすでに、<br>並び立つ者がいないほど武勲を立てておられるご様子。
#. de: Du hast viel geleistet, im Süden wie im Norden Bozjas. So viel wie kein anderer.
#. fr: Sans vouloir vous flatter, vous êtes déjà <if $gn4>la soldate la<else>le soldat le</if> plus décoré<if $gn4>e</if> de tout Bozja.
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_100:1"
msgid "My apologies, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, but you are no longer eligible to receive proofs of mettle."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これ以上、解放者殿に、<br>「戦果認定証」をお渡しする必要はございません。<br><if $gn4>貴女<else>貴方</if>の武勇は、この戦場に十分知れ渡っているのですから……！
#. de: Ich kann dir keine weiteren Frontwissen-Marken geben. Du hast bereits alles erreicht, was zu erreichen ist.
#. fr: Plus de médailles et vous vous traînerez sur le champ de bataille<nbsp>! De plus, votre renommée de <if $gn4>grande libératrice<else>grand libérateur</if> n'est plus à faire<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_101:1"
msgid "I am afraid there are only so many honors one soldier can receive."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 恐れながら、解放者殿の現在の戦果は、<br>「戦果認定証」をお渡しするには不足されているご様子……。<br>今一度、戦場にて功績を上げてお越しいただけますと幸いです。
#. de: Es tut mir leid, aber du hast nicht genug Frontwissen, um dafür Marken zu erhalten. Begib dich wieder in den Kampf und sammle neues Wissen auf unseren Schlachtfeldern im Norden und im Süden.
#. fr: Désolé, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, mais il va vous falloir accomplir plus de faits d'armes avant que je puisse vous octroyer une attestation. Le champ de bataille vous offrira cette opportunité, alors je vous invite à vous y rendre et à défendre Bozja<nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_110:1"
msgid "My apologies, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, but you do not presently meet the requirements to receive proofs of mettle."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「戦果認定証」を受け取るためには、<br>戦果を「<num $n1>」以上、所持している必要があります。
#. de: Um Frontwissen-Marken zu erhalten, musst du über mindestens <kilo $n1 "."> Frontwissen verfügen.
#. fr: Vous devez avoir au moins <kilo "<num $n1>" "<nbsp>"> point<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> de faits d'armes pour obtenir une attestation de services rendus.
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_SYSTEM_000_111:1"
msgid "At least <kilo $n1 \",\"> mettle is required to receive proofs of mettle."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「戦果認定証」をご所望ですね？<br>それでは、<if $gn4>貴女<else>貴方</if>の戦果を確認させていただきます！
#. de: Frontwissen-Marken? Dann lass mich mal sehen, wie viel du über unsere Fronten weißt.
#. fr: Vous pensez avoir mérité une attestation de services rendus<nbsp>? Parfait, laissez-moi vérifier ça.
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_120:1"
msgid "You wish to receive proofs of mettle? Then let us have a look at your combat records."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 現在の所持戦果は「<num $n1>」です。<br>戦果を「<num $n2>」消費し、<br>戦果認定証を「<num $n3>」枚、入手しますか？
#. de: Du verfügst über <kilo $n1 "."> Frontwissen.<br>Möchtest du <kilo $n2 "."> Frontwissen gegen <num $n3> Frontwissen-<if ($n3 == 1)>Marke<else>Marken</if> eintauschen?
#. fr: Vous avez accumulé <kilo "<num $n1>" "<nbsp>"> point<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> de faits d'armes. Souhaitez-vous en utiliser <kilo "<num $n2>" "<nbsp>"> pour obtenir <kilo "<num $n3>" "<nbsp>"> attestation<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> de services rendus<nbsp>?
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <kilo $n2 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 2, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_Q2_000_000:1"
msgid "You have currently amassed <kilo $n1 \",\"> mettle.<br>Expend <kilo $n2 \",\"> mettle to receive <num $n3> proof<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> of mettle?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: まこと素晴らしき戦果を上げてらっしゃることを確認しました！<br>それでは、「戦果認定証」をお受け取りください！
#. de: Und ob du etwas über die Lage an unseren Fronten weißt! Eine ganze Menge sogar. Hier, ich bestätige dir dein Wissen mit meinen Marken.
#. fr: Vous m'impressionnerez toujours<nbsp>! Tenez, vous avez bien mérité cette récompense<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_130:1"
msgid "A reward well earned, I must say."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 集めた「戦果認定証」をお持ちいただくことで、<br>「レジスタンス勲章」を授与させていただきます。<br>戦果認定証が集まりましたら、どうぞまたお声がけください。
#. de: Wenn du genügend Frontwissen-Marken gesammelt hast, verleihe ich dir dafür Widerstandsorden. Du musst mich nur darauf ansprechen.
#. fr: N'oubliez pas que ces attestations ne vous apporteront rien tant que vous ne me les aurez pas échangées contre des médailles. Revenez donc me voir lorsque vous voudrez que je vous en donne en échange.
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_135:1"
msgid "When you have made your decision, speak with me again that we might discuss which honors you wish to receive."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 勲章には戦場での活躍を祈る術式が刻まれており、<br>多く身につけるほどに、その加護も強まると言われております。<br>さらなる高みを目指すのであれば、ぜひに……！
#. de: Sammle weiter fleißig Frontwissen-Marken, um dir noch mehr Widerstandsorden an deine Brust stecken zu können. Je mehr, desto besser, das ist klar!
#. fr: Une prière est gravée sur les médailles que je peux vous remettre. Plus vous en porterez et plus leur protection sera puissante, accumulez-en donc un maximum<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_140:1"
msgid "Though I have not witnessed it with my own eyes, I have heard tales of what one might accomplish with the blessings of these accolades. You would do well to earn more if greater glory on the battlefield is what you seek."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 解放者殿の武功を、この戦場で耳にしていない者はおりません。<br>そのご活躍ぶり、さながら伝説の軍神のごとく……。<br>勲章の加護を得た解放者のお力が、これほどとは……！
#. de: Kein Kämpfer des Widerstands hat je so viele Orden an seiner Brust getragen! Deine Leistungen sind beispiellos. Du bist wirklich eine lebende Legende.
#. fr: Jamais je n'aurai cru que vous deviendriez si puissant<if $gn4>e</if> grâce à nos médailles<nbsp>! Vous êtes connu comme le loup blanc parmi les Bozjiens, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Continuez comme ça, et vous aurez d'ici peu votre place au côté de nos Dieux guerriers<nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_145:1"
msgid "There is not a soldier in all of the Resistance that has yet to hear of your accomplishments. Indeed, our historians are quite eager to chronicle the ventures of Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, war hero and liberator of Bozja."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「レジスタンス勲章」を受け取りたいのですね。<br>それでは、どの勲章がお望みかお答えいただけますか……？
#. de: Du möchtest also, dass ich dir einen Widerstandsorden verleihe? Welcher soll es denn sein?
#. fr: Vous voulez obtenir une décoration, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>? Très bien, dites-moi tout. Laquelle aviez-vous en tête<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_210:1"
msgid "Excellent! Which honors do you wish to receive?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: どの「レジスタンス勲章」を交換しますか？<br>（戦果認定証の所持数：<num $n1>）
#. de: Welchen Widerstandsorden möchtest du erhalten?<br>(Frontwissen-Marken: <num $n1>)
#. fr: Quelle médaille de la résistance souhaitez-vous obtenir<nbsp>?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_Q3_000_000:1"
msgid "Which Resistance honors will you receive?<br>(Proof<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> of Mettle: <num $n1>)"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「堅守彗星章」（<num $n1>/<num $n2>)  必要な戦果認定証：<num $n3>
#. de: Eisenschild-Orden (<num $n1>/<num $n2>)<br>Erforderliche Frontwissen-Marken: <num $n3>
#. fr: Une Comète de l'égide (<num $n1>/<num $n2>) contre <num $n3> attestation<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if>
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A3_000_000:1"
msgid "Sun of Fortitude (<num $n1>/<num $n2>) | Required Proof<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> of Mettle: <num $n3>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「勇猛彗星章」（<num $n1>/<num $n2>)  必要な戦果認定証：<num $n3>
#. de: Blutrausch-Orden (<num $n1>/<num $n2>)<br>Erforderliche Frontwissen-Marken: <num $n3>
#. fr: Une Comète de la furie (<num $n1>/<num $n2>) contre <num $n3> attestation<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if>
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A3_000_001:1"
msgid "Sun of Valor (<num $n1>/<num $n2>) | Required Proof<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> of Mettle: <num $n3>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「救命彗星章」（<num $n1>/<num $n2>)  必要な戦果認定証：<num $n3>
#. de: Lebensretter-Orden (<num $n1>/<num $n2>)<br>Erforderliche Frontwissen-Marken: <num $n3>
#. fr: Une Comète du salut (<num $n1>/<num $n2>) contre <num $n3> attestation<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if>
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A3_000_002:1"
msgid "Sun of Succor (<num $n1>/<num $n2>) | Required Proof<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> of Mettle: <num $n3>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_A3_000_010:1"
msgid "Return"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……おや、残念ながら、<br>そちらの「レジスタンス勲章」をお渡しするためには、<br>「戦果認定証」が足りないようです……。
#. de: Ach, sieht so aus, als hättest du nicht genug Frontwissen-Marken ...
#. fr: Désolé, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Je ne peux pas vous remettre cette décoration si vous n'avez pas le nombre d'attestations nécessaires.
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_230:1"
msgid "My apologies, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, but you require more proofs of mettle to receive such an honor."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 戦場にてさらなる「戦果」を上げ、お越しいただければ、<br>それに見合った「戦果認定証」をお渡しさせていただきます。
#. de: Begib dich auf eins unserer Schlachtfelder im Norden oder Süden und sammle weiter Frontwissen. Wenn du genug hast, bezeuge ich dir das mit meinen Frontwissen-Marken.
#. fr: Mais vous finirez par l'obtenir si vous vous démarquez sur le champ de bataille. Revenez me voir une fois que vous aurez accompli plus de faits d'armes, et je vous offrirai alors plus d'attestations.
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_061:1"
msgid "If you have amassed sufficient mettle, we may speak again about any additional proofs you require."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 戦果認定証を、<num $n1>枚消費して、<br>「堅守彗星章」を受け取りますか？
#. de: Möchtest du <num $n1> Frontwissen-<if ($n1 == 1)>Marke<else>Marken</if> abgeben und dafür 1 Eisenschild-Orden erhalten?
#. fr: Échanger <num $n1> attestation<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> contre une Comète de l'égide<nbsp>?
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_Q4_000_000:1"
msgid "Receive a Sun of Fortitude in exchange for <num $n1> proof<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> of mettle?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 戦果認定証を、<num $n1>枚消費して、<br>「勇猛彗星章」を受け取りますか？
#. de: Möchtest du <num $n1> Frontwissen-<if ($n1 == 1)>Marke<else>Marken</if> abgeben und dafür 1 Blutrausch-Orden erhalten?
#. fr: Échanger <num $n1> attestation<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> contre une Comète de la furie<nbsp>?
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_Q4_000_001:1"
msgid "Receive a Sun of Valor in exchange for <num $n1> proof<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> of mettle?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 戦果認定証を、<num $n1>枚消費して、<br>「救命彗星章」を受け取りますか？
#. de: Möchtest du <num $n1> Frontwissen-<if ($n1 == 1)>Marke<else>Marken</if> abgeben und dafür 1 Lebensretter-Orden erhalten?
#. fr: Échanger <num $n1> attestation<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> contre une Comète du salut<nbsp>?
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_Q4_000_002:1"
msgid "Receive a Sun of Succor in exchange for <num $n1> proof<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> of mettle?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: たしかに、戦果認定証は揃っておりますね。<br>それでは、「レジスタンス勲章」をお受取りください……！
#. de: Ah ja, das sieht sehr gut aus. Und nun verleihe ich dir deinen Widerstandsorden ...
#. fr: Le compte y est<nbsp>! <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, c'est un honneur pour moi de vous remettre cette médaille<nbsp>! Arborez-la fièrement et son enchantement vous aidera lors de vos combats en Bozja<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_250:1"
msgid "Yes, this is the requisite number of proofs. On behalf of the Resistance, it is my honor and privilege to award you this Resistance honor."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この勲章は、ボズヤの全兵士が憧れる、いわば強者の象徴。<br>勲章を手にした解放者殿が戦場を駆ける姿を見れば、<br>皆、勇気づけられることでしょう！
#. de: Dafür wird man dich auf dem Schlachtfeld beneiden. Und sicher wirst du die Herzen deiner Kameraden mit neuem Mut füllen!
#. fr: Ces récompenses sont la marque des héros et la convoitise de tous nos soldats. Le simple fait de vous voir avec sur le champ de bataille les motivera à se battre avec encore plus de hargne<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_251:1"
msgid "May it offer you the courage and protection needed to overcome all who would oppose you, and serve to enhearten those who might fight at your side."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 解放者殿……！<br><if $gn4>貴女<else>貴方</if>はついに、すべての「レジスタンス勲章」を手にしました！
#. de: Oha! Damit hast du alle Widerstandsorden erhalten! Was sagt man dazu?
#. fr: D'autre part, c'est un grand jour, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Vous venez d'obtenir la dernière médaille que je pouvais vous remettre<nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_270:1"
msgid "If I am not mistaken, Blade <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>, you have now received all honors one might earn in service to the Resistance."
msgstr ""

#. ja: それすなわち、この戦場において比類なき武人となられた証！<br>その働きに、我らボズヤの兵はもちろん、<br>戦場で闘うすべての者が、崇敬の念を抱くことでしょう！
#. de: Niemand hat sich so um unseren Widerstand verdient gemacht wie du! Lass die Orden an deiner Brust prangen und erinnere uns daran, was mit Mut und Stärke erreicht werden kann.
#. fr: Autrement dit, vous pouvez désormais vous vanter d'être <if $gn4>la guerrière la<else>le guerrier le</if> plus décoré<if $gn4>e</if> de Bozja<nbsp>! Vous avez atteint le rang de légende vivante au sein de la résistance, et j'imagine que nombre de nos compagnons vont vous vénérer maintenant<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_271:1"
msgid "In all my time with the Resistance, no soldier has shown such dedication to our cause."
msgstr ""

#. ja: その類まれな武勇をもって、<br>我らに助力いただければ、これほど頼もしいことはございません。<br>今後も解放者殿にお力添えいただければ、幸いでございます！
#. de: Du bist uns allen ein strahlendes Vorbild. Kämpfe weiter in unserer Mitte, damit wir an deiner Kraft teilhaben können.
#. fr: Savoir qu'<if $gn4>une femme<else>un homme</if> comme vous se bat pour notre cause... Votre courage insurpassable remplira toujours nos cœurs de hardiesse<nbsp>! Nous verrons chacune de vos sorties comme un don du ciel<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_RESISTANCECOUNCILOR_000_272:1"
msgid "We could never hope to repay all you have done for us, but know that, so long as Bozja stands, her people shall never forget the hero to whom they owe their freedom."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「レジスタンス勲章」によるステータス上昇効果が、<br>全種類、最大まで付与されました！
#. de: Herzlichen Glückwunsch! Du hast alle Widerstandsorden erhalten und die höchstmöglichen Statuseffekte erreicht!
#. fr: Vous bénéficiez désormais des bonus maximums offerts par les médailles de la résistance<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/CtsMycMedal_00719:TEXT_CTSMYCMEDAL_00719_SYSTEM_000_273:1"
msgid "You have been awarded full honors for your contributions to the Resistance!"
msgstr ""
